        <mxCell id="s1-today-content" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;padding:10px'&gt;1️⃣ Add to &lt;b&gt;CAMPAIGN_METADATA&lt;/b&gt; dict&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ campaign_name, success_type, metric, channel&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2️⃣ Add to &lt;b&gt;ALL_MNES&lt;/b&gt; list&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3️⃣ May need new &lt;b&gt;SUCCESS_DEFINITION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ table_path, filters, date_field&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4️⃣ Update &lt;b&gt;run_all_campaigns()&lt;/b&gt; if special logic&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#922b21'&gt;⚠️ Requires code deployment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
